{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">日本東京發生名表搶劫案，警方正追捕兩名匪徒。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">發生搶劫案的鐘表店，有玻璃被敲碎，調查人員案發後在店內搜查。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.ROBBERY-2330_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026SNWPWJafhI1787671257.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JP.ROBBERY-2330_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發在東京中野區百老匯商業中心，周二中午左右，當地傳媒引述目擊者報道，疑犯敲碎玻璃展示櫃，僅用約十秒時間偷走四隻，總值約2億日圓，折合約九百八十萬港幣的名表，其後兩名穿著黑色衣服的男子，乘電動滑板車逃走。當局仍在追捕兩名匪徒。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T16:06:09.249048+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}